  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        524.3741455078125,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "enrolled in the trials – all of whom were HIV-negative and had limited exposure to other QT interval-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.494140625,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "prolonging medications – did not appear to exceed that of adults. The variability present in the limited",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972867012023926,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3778076171875,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "sample size precluded a comment on exposure–response (safety). The GDG 2018 also concluded that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973718643188477,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4387817382812,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "the risk–benefit considerations for the use of bedaquiline in patients aged 6–17 years are similar to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4277954101562,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "those considered for adults; however, the GDG stressed the need for more data before considering",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        274.9986267089844,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "upgrading this recommendation to “strong”.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09461975097656,
        527.2474365234375,
        169.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "The GDG review in 2021 determined that the balance between desirable and undesirable effects",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.2946319580078,
        527.38916015625,
        182.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "probably favours the use of bedaquiline in children aged below 6 years. The GDG 2021 highlighted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.4003295898438,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "that the benefits may vary depending on specific contexts and population characteristics, such as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        524.4227294921875,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "by nutritional status. The GDG also noted that the potential higher cost of bedaquiline in an MDR/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        524.4115600585938,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "RR-TB treatment regimen should be considered in the context of the benefits of shorter injectable-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.3916015625,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "free regimens (i.e. less travel, reduced time spent in clinics and fewer AEs). In addition, they judged",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.4244995117188,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "that equity might increase when bedaquiline becomes available to younger children, because its use",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.4551391601562,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "would be acceptable to most stakeholders, and that one of the main feasibility aspects would be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.392333984375,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "related to the need for safety monitoring (i.e. access to ECG monitoring, as well as staff capacity for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.4312744140625,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "monitoring). However, the panel judged that implementing the use of bedaquiline in young children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        174.75119018554688,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "was probably feasible.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.4948120117188,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "With respect to the use of delamanid in children aged below 6 years, the GDG review in 2018",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.4397583007812,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "decided that – based on findings in adults, and on the pharmacological and safety data reviewed –",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.529052734375,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "extrapolations on efficacy and safety should be restricted to children aged 3–5 years, but not to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.28863525390625,
        527.4918823242188,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "Annex 5 children aged below 3 years (see ). Exposure profiles in children aged 3–5 years were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.3870849609375,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "comparable to adults, and were no higher than in children aged 6 years and older, for whom past",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.5226135253906,
        527.4313354492188,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "(15, 26) GDGs convened by WHO had already recommended the use of delamanid  . Based on the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.3916015625,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "laboratory and cardiac data provided, no safety signals distinct from those reported in adults were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.433349609375,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "observed in children aged 3–5 years. The GDG nonetheless had concerns about the feasibility of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        527.4034423828125,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "administering the correct dose to children aged 3–5 years, given that the special formulation used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.5986022949219,
        527.3782348632812,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "in the trial (25 mg) would not be available in the foreseeable future, and that only the adult tablet",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.7986145019531,
        527.4213256835938,
        455.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "(50 mg) is available, which is not bioequivalent and presents challenges to manipulating its contents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.99859619140625,
        253.13172912597656,
        468.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "without compromising its effectiveness.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.7025146484375,
        527.584228515625,
        490.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "The GDG review in 2021 concluded that the balance between desirable and undesirable effects",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.9026184082031,
        527.3936767578125,
        503.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "probably favours the use of delamanid in children aged below 3 years. The GDG 2021 further stated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        502.10260009765625,
        527.249755859375,
        516.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "that when the 25 mg dispersible tablet became available in the future, the resource implications",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.302490234375,
        527.4068603515625,
        529.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "could vary. It was thought that delamanid containing longer treatment regimens could potentially",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.5025634765625,
        527.3902587890625,
        542.945556640625
      ],
      "text": "increase equity and be acceptable to stakeholders. In addition, the GDG 2021 judged that it would",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        541.7025146484375,
        527.632080078125,
        556.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "probably be feasible to use delamanid in children of all ages, especially as the child-friendly formulation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950187683105469,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        554.902587890625,
        527.5781860351562,
        569.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "of delamanid was expected to become available later in 2021 (this formulation is now available).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.1026000976562,
        527.6331787109375,
        582.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "This judgement also considered that adult tablets cannot be split, crushed or dissolved to ease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        581.302490234375,
        380.696533203125,
        595.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "administration in children without potentially altering bioavailability.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        603.0064697265625,
        527.5960083007812,
        617.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "As a result of these multiple reviews as new data have gradually become available, the use of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        616.20654296875,
        425.51055908203125,
        630.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "bedaquiline and delamanid are no longer restricted by the age of the patient.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "124 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
